# sonarr.rules

## Purpose
Handles integration with Sonarr for automating TV show downloads via Overseerr.

## Trigger Conditions
- User accepts a TV show recommendation.
- Explicit user command (e.g., "Download all of Season 2").
- Overseerr approves a TV show request.

## Metadata Required
- title
- year
- TVDB ID or TMDB ID
- number of seasons
- number of episodes (if applicable)
- quality profile
- language
- root folder path
- monitored (bool)
- tags (optional)

## Expected API Usage
- POST /api/v3/series to create a monitored show.
- POST /api/v3/episode to control specific episodes.
- GET /api/v3/series/{id} for status and metadata.
- POST /api/v3/command with "type": "SeriesSearch" to initiate search.

## Safety Checks
- Verify that Sonarr is reachable.
- Check if the series already exists.
- Validate quality profile against user preference.
- Avoid duplicate requests.

## UX Notes
- Inform user of missing metadata.
- Allow toggling between monitored/unmonitored per season.
